{"id":"resp_84526ccb0444ae1c","created_at":1795604593,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"metadata":null,"model":"gpt-oss-120b","object":"response","output":[{"id":"rs_b141ad010af4fe1b","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"We need to produce SHACL shapes based on the supplied schema terms and the requirement: TRF-035 clause 4.1.1: \"L shall be taken as the ship's rule length used by the classification society.\"\n\nThe schema defines:\n\n- ruleLength: ObjectProperty, domain benchmarkEntity, range QuantityValue, unit M.\n\n- classificationSocietyRuleLength: ObjectProperty, domain benchmarkEntity, range QuantityValue, unit M.\n\n- classificationSociety: DatatypeProperty, domain benchmarkEntity, range xsd:string.\n\n- hullRegion (object property) etc.\n\nBut for this requirement we need to enforce that for any ship (owner class ship) there must be a ruleLength (or maybe classificationSocietyRuleLength?) that corresponds to L. In the admission, they said option A: recorded ruleLength and a separately supplied classificationSocietyRuleLength reference datum. So we need shapes that target the ship class (owner_class). The shape should enforce that ship has property ruleLength with a quantity value (type QuantityValue) with numeric value and unit (meter). Also perhaps classificationSocietyRuleLength is required? The requirement states L is the ship's rule length used by the classification society. So we need to capture that ruleLength is taken as the ship's rule length used by the classification society. So we can require property ruleLength and also perhaps ensure that classificationSocietyRuleLength is same as ruleLength? But no explicit equality given. Could just require that both are present.\n\nWe need to use quantityEncoding numeric predicate and unit predicate as per JSON-LD context: numeric predicate is http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/numericValue, unit predicate is http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/unit.\n\nThus shape constraints: sh:property with path ruleLength, sh:node with class qudt:QuantityValue, sh:property for numericValue with datatype xsd:decimal, sh:property for unit with value <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> (or sh:hasValue). Use sh:hasValue for unit.\n\nSimilarly for classificationSocietyRuleLength.\n\nAlso maybe require classificationSociety property with datatype string.\n\nWe must preserve target class: sh:targetClass https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship.\n\nNo extra invented selectors.\n\nWe need to include unresolved ownership notes: but all owners are ship (as per termOwners), okay.\n\nAlso unresolved source context etc not needed in shape.\n\nReturn <BEGIN_SHACL> line then Turtle then <END_SHACL>.\n\nWe'll construct prefixes.\n\nUse prefixes: sh, rdf, rdfs, xsd, qudt, nltl (https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#), ex maybe.\n\nWrite shape ex:ShipRuleLengthShape.\n\nAdd sh:targetClass nltl:ship.\n\nAdd sh:property for nltl:ruleLength with sh:nodeKind sh:IRI? Actually ruleLength points to QuantityValue individuals. So use sh:class qudt:QuantityValue as node constraint.\n\nInside that node shape we enforce properties numericValue and unit.\n\nWe can define inline node shape using sh:property.\n\nExample:\n\nsh:property [\n    sh:path nltl:ruleLength ;\n    sh:node [\n        a sh:NodeShape ;\n        sh:property [\n            sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n            sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n            sh:minCount 1 ;\n            sh:maxCount 1 ;\n        ] ;\n        sh:property [\n            sh:path qudt:unit ;\n            sh:hasValue <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> ;\n            sh:minCount 1 ;\n            sh:maxCount 1 ;\n        ] ;\n    ] ;\n    sh:minCount 1 ;\n    sh:maxCount 1 ;\n] .\n\nSimilarly for nltl:classificationSocietyRuleLength.\n\nAnd classificationSociety property: sh:datatype xsd:string, minCount 1.\n\nAdd comments referencing source.\n\nWe'll include rdfs:comment with requirement text.\n\nNow produce final.","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":null,"status":null},{"id":"msg_bd3bdfb89a09cc61","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"<BEGIN_SHACL>\n@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .\n@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .\n@prefix nltl: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#> .\n@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/shapes#> .\n\n# Shape expressing TRF‑035 clause 4.1.1\nex:ShipRuleLengthShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass nltl:ship ;\n    rdfs:comment \"TRF‑035 | Ice Class Regulations – clause 4.1.1: “L shall be taken as the ship's rule length used by the classification society.”\" ;\n    \n    # ruleLength – the ship's rule length (QuantityValue in metres)\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:ruleLength ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:maxCount 1 ;\n        sh:node [\n            a sh:NodeShape ;\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n                sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n                sh:minCount 1 ;\n                sh:maxCount 1 ;\n                rdfs:comment \"Numeric value of the rule length (metres).\" ;\n            ] ;\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path qudt:unit ;\n                sh:hasValue <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> ;\n                sh:minCount 1 ;\n                sh:maxCount 1 ;\n                rdfs:comment \"Unit must be the canonical metre unit.\" ;\n            ] ;\n        ] ;\n    ] ;\n    \n    # classificationSocietyRuleLength – rule length as recorded by the classification society\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:classificationSocietyRuleLength ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:maxCount 1 ;\n        sh:node [\n            a sh:NodeShape ;\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n                sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n                sh:minCount 1 ;\n                sh:maxCount 1 ;\n                rdfs:comment \"Numeric value of the classification‑society rule length (metres).\" ;\n            ] ;\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path qudt:unit ;\n                sh:hasValue <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> ;\n                sh:minCount 1 ;\n                sh:maxCount 1 ;\n                rdfs:comment \"Unit must be the canonical metre unit.\" ;\n            ] ;\n        ] ;\n    ] ;\n    \n    # classificationSociety – name of the classification society (string)\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:classificationSociety ;\n        sh:datatype xsd:string ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:maxCount 1 ;\n        rdfs:comment \"Name of the classification society that provides the rule length.\" ;\n    ] .\n<END_SHACL>","type":"output_text","logprobs":null}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":null}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":1.0,"background":false,"max_output_tokens":16000,"max_tool_calls":null,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt":null,"prompt_cache_options":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":null,"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"auto","status":"completed","text":null,"top_logprobs":null,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":38459,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":38448,"cache_write_tokens":0,"input_tokens_per_turn":[38459],"cached_tokens_per_turn":[38448]},"output_tokens":1512,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":821,"tool_output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_per_turn":[1512],"tool_output_tokens_per_turn":[0]},"total_tokens":39971},"user":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"input_messages":null,"output_messages":null}